<style>
/* Pricing & Promotions page - Shopify scoped styling */
.ms-pricing-promos{
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px 40px;
  font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #000000;
}
.ms-pricing-promos,
.ms-pricing-promos *{
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif !important;
}
.ms-pricing-promos p,
.ms-pricing-promos li,
.ms-pricing-promos a,
.ms-pricing-promos span,
.ms-pricing-promos strong,
.ms-pricing-promos em{
  font-size: 18px !important;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #000000;
}
.ms-pricing-promos h2,
.ms-pricing-promos h2 *{
  font-size: 40px !important;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-pricing-promos h3,
.ms-pricing-promos h3 *{
  font-size: 25px !important;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-pricing-promos h4,
.ms-pricing-promos h4 *{
  font-size: 20px !important;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-pricing-promos a{
  color: #007681 !important;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}
@media (max-width: 749px){
  .ms-pricing-promos{
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 12px;
  }
  .ms-pricing-promos h2,
  .ms-pricing-promos h2 *{
    font-size: 32px !important;
  }
}
</style>

<section class="ms-pricing-promos" aria-label="Pricing and Promotions">
<div style="font-size: 18px;">
<p style="background-color: #007681; height: 35px;">&nbsp;</p>
<h3>How do I find out when a coupon, deal, promotion or offer ends? Can I still use the coupon after the expiration date?</h3>
<p><span>The expiration date for any coupon, deal, promotion or offer will always be plainly explained. Prices found in the weekly deals email are only good for the week&nbsp;</span>specified,<span>&nbsp;unless otherwise noted. Unfortunately, offers,&nbsp;</span>deals<span>&nbsp;and coupons are not valid after the expiration date.</span></p>
<h3><span>Where can I find out about special promotions, offers and discounts?</span></h3>
<p><span>We will update the Monroe home page to feature images of current sale information. You can also find out about special promotions by connecting with us on Facebook, Twitter and LinkedIn or by signing up for our&nbsp;</span><a style="color: #007681;" title="Monroe Systems for Business Weekly Email Signup Form" href="https://share.hsforms.com/1KGMBcoRGRfipAgbdmE8C7Qci5z2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">weekly emails</a><span>.</span></p>
<h3>Is there a way to get email updates about special deals and offers?</h3>
<p>Yes. At the bottom of our website, you&rsquo;ll see the option to get information on deals. If you click on the text and provide your email address, you&rsquo;ll start receiving email updates from us about our latest deals.</p>
<h3>Pricing is subject to change on the website. Email promotions are based on retail website pricing.</h3>
<p style="background-color: #007681; height: 35px;">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</section>

